profiles=[
('Luka Dončić',PG,'2026-08-05','01:27:17–01:37:18','On-ball physical imposition, every-pass playmaking, P&R/isolation and huge shotmaking; reduced rim access/longer shot distance, health, defensive targeting; island coverage can reduce team offense.','Repeated probing/space creation and broad passing repertoire support uncertain family-specific estimates. Every-pass praise supports breadth, not separately measured pass types or turnover causes. No specific cross-court distinction is supported here, so F07 remains unknown.'),
('Shai Gilgeous-Alexander',PG,'2026-08-05','01:32:08–01:43:34','Exceptional isolation/P&R, rim/FT pressure, turnover suppression, improving playmaking and positive defense; loaded playoff defenses reduced dominance.','Scoring craft and security are clearer than any particular pass family; improving passing is not evidence of Luka-level breadth or a measured steal technique.'),
('Jalen Brunson',PG,'2026-08-05','01:06:18–01:17:50','High-volume/clutch scoring and turnover suppression; passing below elite engine comparisons, defensive liability insulated by Knicks infrastructure.','Scoring creation/security can be strong without all-world reads. Reduced-defense conclusion does not independently diagnose inattention or physical speed.'),
('Cade Cunningham',PG,'2026-08-05','01:16:54–01:27:17','High-load big-guard creation amid poor spacing; physical/creative crowded-paint play and difficult defensive assignment; high turnovers, inside/pull-up consistency and growth uncertainty.','Creation/defense and turnover concern coexist. Turnovers have unknown cause; a broad security concern is a hypothesis, not proved dribbling losses.'),
('Darius Garland',PG,'2026-08-05','00:10:42–00:12:15;00:22:05–00:29:26','Elite handle/change of pace/quickness, P&R and passing, on/off-ball shooting and floater; physical playoff translation, rim/FT limitations, small-guard defense and repeated injury concerns.','Manipulation, craft and roll/kick reads are plausible; raw security under pressure is less directly established. Healthy quickness is not injury-adjusted speed.'),
('Dylan Harper',PG,'2026-08-05','00:29:26–00:39:09','Size, handle, pace, body control, paint access/varied finishes, strong security and stabilizing decisions; useful defense; advanced passing reads and perimeter shot need growth.','Present craft/security can exceed advanced read breadth. Delivery may be adequate for simple kick windows; a higher delivery midpoint is a hypothesis, not an observed dissociation.'),
('Desmond Bane',SG,'2026-08-14','00:50:00–01:00:00;01:06:00–01:10:00','Shooting, straight-line physical drives, touch and passing; pressure/switching, inside finishing and separation limit playoffs; exceptional opponents are counterweight.','Separation and pressure manipulation can lag shooting. These failures do not by themselves establish poor handle security or inaccurate kick passes.'),
('Stephon Castle',PG,'2026-08-05','00:14:56–00:22:05;00:26:37–00:29:26','Elite POA defense/star assignments, downhill pressure and useful playmaking; turnovers/scoring limits, high fouls and weaker off-ball/secondary-help disruption; Wembanyama support matters.','Containment and contact craft likely strong. Helper recognition/attention/foul-control decomposition is less certain. Turnover concern is not a labeled lost-ball sample.'),
('Derrick White',SG,'2026-08-14','01:34:00–01:44:00','Defensive anticipation/positioning, POA pressure and guard rim playmaking; good decisions/passing/handling, low turnovers; weak inside self-creation and poor shooting season.','Secure connector with early help reads need not be primary drive creator. Blocks/on-off are corroborating context, not direct timing or IQ measurements.'),
('Scottie Barnes',PF,'2026-08-28','01:10:00–01:17:38','Lead/playoff creation growth, short-range scoring, elite passing and defensive versatility/hands, guards/wings POA plus help/rim protection; inconsistent threes and lead-scoring ceiling.','Strong help/containment and drive-to-pass hypotheses. Elite passing does not independently establish lob, skip and pocket subskills; only limited family estimates are offered.'),
('Rudy Gobert',CE,'2026-09-02','00:51:38–00:59:07','Elite rim coverage/consistency, successful post-defense and ability to switch/defend space; severe offensive limitations, expected improved involvement with creator.','Pass-dependent finishing is an opportunity contrast, not poor receiving or lob-technique proof. Anchor value supports spatial awareness broadly, not automatic elite perimeter containment.'),
('Bam Adebayo',CE,'2026-09-02','01:06:54–01:13:07','Excellent versatile switching defense, playmaking/creation and availability; inefficient jumper-heavy offense, future Giannis fit uncertain; Chet has greater rim deterrence.','Switching supports containment/contact hypotheses with tools confounded. Generic playmaking does not identify pocket/lob delivery; connector estimates are safer than all-family copying.')]
